e mirror shattered, but people&rsquo;s eyes were mirrors, he couldn&#39;t escape and everyone could see his ugliness and he wanted to vanish-</p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&quot;, &quot;GNU Unifont&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">He woke, tears in his eyes.</p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&quot;, &quot;GNU Unifont&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&quot;, &quot;GNU Unifont&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">___</p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&quot;, &quot;GNU Unifont&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&quot;, &quot;GNU Unifont&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(Just something to keep me going while I&#39;m working on a Darkwatch story. It&#39;s fun to cause make Ambuscade suffer! :P)</p>",
